{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】本港私人住宅樓價轉跌。</p>\n<p>差餉物業估價署公布，10月私樓樓價指數報319，按月跌百分之0.59，按年升百分之8；樓價與2021年9月高位比較仍低接近兩成。</p>\n<p>10月私人住宅租金指數報213.2，按月升百分之0.47。租金連升12個月，繼續創新高。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:39:54.160578+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:10:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T03:33:24.401827+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:33:24.401827+00:00","content_hash":"3c16f8ac0011861e6b54b8f2ccaa5fadfe1c8b6b06608c9e7ecc042148676d4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}